      "author_display_name": "GlacialClownfish7944",
      "author_alias": "GlacialClownfish7944",
      "developer_response": {
        "body": "Thank you for your feedback! To activate the mission, please make sure you listen to all of the Crab’s dialogue. In your case, the mission should activate once the Crab says: “He won’t see this coming… Swing away, mate!”\n\nYou can confirm whether it has activated by pulling down the visor and checking the Mission Log. To open the Mission Log, activate the visor and tap near the left side of the visor (just outside your field of vision) to toggle the Mission Log screen.\n\nIf the issue persists, please feel free to reach out to us at support@tretastudios.com, and we’ll be happy to help.",
        "date": 1788841208
      }
    },
